    "directions": [
      "Preheat the oven to 190°C.",
      "Mix together 50g grated Parmigiano Reggiano with the Greek yoghurt, garlic and plenty of black pepper.",
      "Lay the chicken breasts on a grill pan and top with a good layer of the yoghurt mixture.",
      "Sprinkle over some more grated Parmigiano Reggiano.",
      "Bake in the oven for 30-35 minutes or until cooked through and golden."
